    ['sc8-4', 'Evaluate', 'A vendor says blockchain will make supplier data accurate. What is the flaw?', 'It cannot make wrong data entered true', ['It cannot store any records at all', 'It is illegal in international trade', 'Only one party can ever read the ledger'], 'A ledger is tamper-evident after entry; false entries stay false.', ['It stores records.', 'It is legal.', 'Sharing is its point.'], 'M8.C'],
    ['sc8-4', 'Analyze', 'A machine-learning forecast beats nothing because no one compared it with a baseline. What is missing?', 'A check against a simple forecast', ['More data on product colors', 'A larger server to run the model faster', 'A new name for the model'], 'Forecast value is shown by beating a simple baseline on error.', ['Irrelevant data does not help.', 'Hardware is not the test.', 'Naming is irrelevant.'], 'M8.C']
